Folio Graze
Copyright 2026 Ron Shillings. Part of Folio Studio.

Folio Graze is written in Rust on Folio's own platform layer and toolkit. Web pages are shown
by the system's WebKitGTK engine (LGPL-2.1), which is installed from the distribution, not
bundled. Compiled in (MIT or Apache-2.0 unless noted): gtk-rs, webkit2gtk-rs and
javascriptcore-rs (bindings); winit, softbuffer, arboard, smithay-clipboard; tiny-skia and
resvg (drawing); cosmic-text, swash, fontdb, harfrust (text, fonts); image; serde,
serde_json; libm; getrandom.

Icons are original.
